faq:
  - q: How does it work with our accounting software?
    a: It sits beside it. HelioLattice runs the operational money workflow next to the job and exports claims to Excel, Tally XML and Tally JSON, so your accountant continues in the package they already use.
  - q: Can we see the pending amount on each project?
    a: Yes. Each project shows collected and pending amounts, outstanding receivable and payable, and its claims by status.
  - q: Who can approve an expense?
    a: People whose role holds the approval permission. Submit, verify, approve and post are separate permissions, and a user cannot verify their own claim.
  - q: Can we attach proof to a claim?
    a: Yes. Files are attached to the claim, and categories can require an attachment before submission.
  - q: Can we match bank statements?
    a: Yes. Import a bank statement CSV and match each line to a receipt, vendor payment or entry when the bank matching setting is on for your company.
